flowchart LR
    U[Authenticated operator] -->|Cloud Run IAM| C[Private Cloud Run service]
    C --> D[Dashboard and bounded REST API]
    D --> W[Server-built synthetic workflow]
    D -->|Fixed prompt only| A[Google ADK Runner]
    A --> G[Gemini 3.6 Flash via Developer API Free tier]
    A --> T[One fixed non-executing tool]
    W --> E[Trusted synthetic evidence collector]
    X[Caller-supplied packet] -->|Evidence untrusted by default| H
    E --> H{Deterministic Python gate}
    H --> R[SHA-256 receipt and bounded TTL store]
    H -- Missing, untrusted, or invalid --> B[BLOCKED]
    H -- Exact approval missing --> P[AWAITING_APPROVAL]
    H -- Fingerprint-bound scope matches --> Q[READY_FOR_HUMAN_ACTION]
    Q -. Human-only boundary .-> O[Human operator]
